### 2.2 Namespace Standards

**Application Namespaces**:

```redis
# Authentication service
fusion:auth:{tenant_id}:{entity_type}:{identifier}

# Admin service
fusion:admin:{tenant_id}:{entity_type}:{identifier}

# User management
fusion:user:{tenant_id}:{entity_type}:{identifier}

# Session management
fusion:session:{tenant_id}:{entity_type}:{identifier}

# Caching layer
fusion:cache:{tenant_id}:{entity_type}:{identifier}
```

**System Namespaces**:

```redis
# Configuration data
fusion:config:{environment}:{config_type}:{key}

# Rate limiting
fusion:ratelimit:{tenant_id}:{endpoint}:{identifier}

# Feature flags
fusion:feature:{tenant_id}:{feature_name}

# Metrics and counters
fusion:metrics:{tenant_id}:{metric_type}:{timestamp}
```

